1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
One morning, an old man was walking along the beach after a storm.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
The shore was littered with thousands of starfish,

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
stranded and slowly dying under the rising sun.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
In the distance, he saw a young boy picking something up

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
and gently tossing it into the ocean.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,000
As he got closer, he called out, what are you doing?

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000
The boy looked up and replied, I'm saving starfish.

8
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
The man chuckled, shaking his head.

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
But there are thousands.

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
You can't possibly make a difference.

11
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,000
The boy listened politely, then he bent down, picked up another starfish,

12
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,000
and threw it into the waves.

13
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,000
He looked back at the man and smiled.

14
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,000
I made a difference to that one.

